{
  "note": "Rules applied by build_lists.py before ranking. 'merge' maps a Lexique lemma to the card it belongs to (odd lemma forms, oe ligatures, gender/number forms of one determiner). 'split' lists Lexique rows (lemma + cgram) that get their own card because the meaning really differs. 'drop' removes lemmas outright, with the reason. Rows whose card is led by an article or personal pronoun (ART:def, ART:ind, PRO:per) are dropped by rule.",
